// Github Fork Private Repositories Setting Enabled/Cleared | T1020, T1537 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/application/github/audit/github_fork_private_repos_enabled_or_cleared.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where action in ("private_repository_forking.clear", "private_repository_forking.enable")
